  "instructions": [
    "heat 2 tbsp of ghee or vegetable oil in a non-stick pan over medium heat",
    "dust the pan with a little all-purpose flour to prevent sticking",
    "mix the sesame seeds, granulated sugar, and a pinch of salt in a bowl",
    "add the yogurt, beaten egg, and vanilla extract to the bowl and mix until smooth",
    "add the baking powder and mix well",
    "drop small balls of the mixture into the pan and flatten slightly",
    "fry the mixture until golden brown and crispy, flipping halfway through",
    "remove the fried mixture from the pan and place on a paper towel-lined plate to drain excess oil",
    "serve hot and enjoy"
